-    2 * a * (1 / L + C₁ / L ^ 2) + (b / L + C₁ * b / L ^ 2) - (a / L - C₁ * a / L ^ 2) +
-        (1 / L + C₁ / L ^ 2) * ((b ^ 2 - a ^ 2) / 2) ≤
