-/-!
-# The Selberg majorant of `Λ` and the small prime powers
-
-* For `V > 1` and `n ≥ 1`: `Λ(n) ≤ log n · ν_V(n) + [n = p^e, p ≤ V] Λ(n)`. For a prime power
-  with `p > V`, every divisor `p^i > 1` has weight `0`, so `ν_V(p^e) = 1`.
