-  `w(λ)⁻¹ = 2 e^{a(u−ε)} ∫_{√ε}^{√(c₂+ε)} r² e^{a r²} dr + √(c₂+ε) ∫_v^x e^{at} dt`
-  (`winv`), and `w = 1/winv` (`w`).
-* `vUpper`: an upper bound for the constant `V` of the far bound, through
-  `J_i = K(ih) − K((i+1)h)` with `K(d) = ∫_u^x w₀(t)⁻² (t − u − d)₊ dt`.
