-`m` cells of `[t₀, 2γ)`. Each entry `Ent` names the entry's semantics: its feature is taken at
-`hi` from the response anchor `anc`, its diagonal at the offset `del ≤ s - anc`, and `sp` names a
-second kept zero, if any (`Spec`).
